Laplace's litter box needs to be cleaned.

> brush teeth
You brush your teeth diligently.

> clean litter box
You take care of Laplace's litter box. Now you have a bag of litter that smells
horrible. Better get it out of here.

Judith always wanted to have a cat named Laplace, in part as a reference to the
mathematician, and in part because of her idea that cats prefer names with
prominent sibilants. But you agreed to wait a few years as you both wanted the
freedom to travel, and then all your plans were shattered by the incident. It
took you another twenty years to finally muster up the courage to get Laplace.

You're starting to feel dizzy.

